WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
Let's take a look while leaving

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,200
What happened in the community again?

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,810
Brother Hao and the others are back and someone is injured.

4
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,250
I heard that someone blocked me and robbed me of something.

5
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:09,130
Several people were bleeding and their family members had already gone downstairs.

6
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:13,680
It must be the group of people I met in the morning. My boat is too fast for them to catch up.

7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,280
Zhang Pinghao and the others may not be able to escape.

8
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,370
Robbery also started in the Warning Building.

9
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,810
There are also people guarding the road outside the residential area.

10
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,610
The order outside can't last much longer.

11
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:29,350
How could my son be hurt if he hadn't gone out with you?

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:33,940
He has had a fever for so many days

13
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,020
Who of you has taken care of him?

14
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,500
Now there is no one

15
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,740
At that time, I agreed with myself when I went out.

16
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:45,780
Brother Hao isn't forcing anyone. Just shut up. It's not the death of your family.

17
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:46,860
Of course you speak eloquently

18
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,940
Zhang Pinghao collects money and leads people to buy supplies

19
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,180
He does have his own plans

20
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,900
Now there is a risk of going out if something goes wrong

21
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:52,940
It was made clear from the beginning

22
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:53,900
It's enough to know what's going on

23
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,340
There is no need to continue watching this kind of excitement
